  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "触发与并发",
      "items": [
        "ci.yml 监听 dev/main 的 opened、reopened、synchronize、ready_for_review、edited",
        "同一 PR 再次触发会取消旧运行；三个工作流权限都只有 contents: read",
        "dev push（非纯文档）和手动触发分别启动 dev-integration.yml、release-package.yml"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "变更如何分类",
      "items": [
        "docs/、.codex/、*.md/mdx/rst 记为文档，不选中任何检查",
        "go：*.go、go.mod/sum/work、cmd/、internal/、migrations/；flutter：desktop/；python：scripts/*.py",
        "未知非文档路径或 PR 文件达到 3000 条时，三类检查全部运行",
        "分类 job 失败时，Go 与 Flutter job 先执行 exit 1 直接失败"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "dev 与 main 的差别",
      "items": [
        "dev PR 只运行命中路径的检查，Go/Flutter 各 20 分钟上限",
        "main PR 两类检查无条件全量，Flutter job 延长到 60 分钟并追加 Release 构建、原生 CTest 与完整打包",
        "检查名固定为 Go Windows Checks / Flutter Windows Checks，用作必需检查",
        "main 发布 PR 还要求来源为 dev 分支、作者为 dengweitian0-svg（protect-main.yml）"
      ]
    }
  ]
